---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="About GoAustralia.co.nz — Independent Moving Guide for Kiwis" description="GoAustralia.co.nz is an independent resource built by Kiwis who moved to Australia. Plain-English visa, moving and finance guides — not affiliated with any government.">
<style is:global>
  /* ── ABOUT: MISSION ── */
  .mission-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 52px;
    align-items: start;
  }
  .mission-text h2 {
    font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
    font-size: 1.6rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--navy);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }
  .mission-text p {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--txt2);
    line-height: 1.75;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }
  .stat-boxes {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
  }
  .stat-box {
    background: var(--white);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-lt);
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 18px 22px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 16px;
  }
  .stat-box-num {
    font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
    font-size: 1.65rem;
    font-weight: 900;
    color: var(--navy);
    line-height: 1;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .stat-box-label {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--txt2);
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  /* ── ABOUT: DIFFERENT ── */
  .diff-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 18px;
    margin-top: 36px;
  }
  .diff-card {
    background: var(--white);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-lt);
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 24px;
  }
  .diff-icon {
    width: 36px;
    height: 36px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    background: var(--blue-tint);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .diff-card h3 {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--navy);
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .diff-card p {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--txt2);
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  /* ── ABOUT: DISCLAIMER ── */
  .disclaimer-section {
    background: var(--gold-lt);
    border-top: 1px solid #f0c050;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #f0c050;
    padding: 52px 0;
  }
  .disclaimer-inner {
    max-width: 680px;
  }
  .disclaimer-inner h2 {
    font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #5a3c00;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }
  .disclaimer-inner p {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: #5a3c00;
    line-height: 1.75;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .disclaimer-inner a {
    color: var(--gold);
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
  .disclaimer-inner p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  /* ── RESPONSIVE ── */
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .mission-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 36px; }
    .diff-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .diff-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
</style>

<!-- PAGE HERO -->
<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">← Home</a> / About</div>
    <h1>About GoAustralia.co.nz</h1>
    <p class="page-hero-sub">An independent resource built by Kiwis, for Kiwis. We make the Australian move make sense.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- MISSION -->
<section class="section">
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="mission-grid">

      <div class="mission-text">
        <p class="sec-eye">Why we exist</p>
        <h2>We built this because we moved to Australia and couldn't find a straight answer</h2>
        <p>When we made the move ourselves, we spent weeks trying to figure out the basics — which visa applied to us, what tax obligations we had across two countries, which suburbs were actually liveable on a Kiwi salary. Every page on the Australian Government site seemed to be written for people who already understood immigration law.</p>
        <p>So we wrote the guide we wished existed. Plain English, Kiwi-specific, covering everything from the day you decide to move through to your first tax return in Australia.</p>
        <p>GoAustralia.co.nz has been helping Kiwis since 2021. We update the guides every week to reflect policy changes, exchange rate shifts and visa rule updates.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="stat-boxes">
        <div class="stat-box reveal d1">
          <div class="stat-box-num">12,400+</div>
          <div class="stat-box-label">Kiwis have used GoAustralia to plan their move</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-box reveal d2">
          <div class="stat-box-num">4.9★</div>
          <div class="stat-box-label">Average rating from verified subscribers</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-box reveal d3">
          <div class="stat-box-num">Weekly</div>
          <div class="stat-box-label">All guides and tools are reviewed and updated every week</div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- HOW WE'RE DIFFERENT -->
<section class="section section-alt">
  <div class="shell">
    <div style="text-align:center;">
      <p class="sec-eye">Why GoAustralia</p>
      <h2 class="sec-h2">How we're different</h2>
      <p class="sec-sub" style="margin: 0 auto;">We're not a generic immigration site. We're built for one specific journey: New Zealand to Australia.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="diff-grid">
      <div class="diff-card reveal d1">
        <div class="diff-icon">🔍</div>
        <h3>Independent — not government affiliated</h3>
        <p>We're not the Australian Government, and we're not funded by any immigration firm or law practice. Our only incentive is to give you accurate, useful information. We recommend you always verify important decisions with official government sources.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="diff-card reveal d2">
        <div class="diff-icon">🗓️</div>
        <h3>Updated every week</h3>
        <p>Australian visa rules, tax thresholds and cost-of-living data change constantly. Every guide, tool and checklist is reviewed weekly. Subscribers get a newsletter every time something important changes so you're never working from outdated information.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="diff-card reveal d3">
        <div class="diff-icon">💬</div>
        <h3>Plain English — no jargon</h3>
        <p>We don't assume you know what a "subclass 444" is or what "Medicare reciprocal arrangements" means before we explain it. Every concept is defined in the same way you'd explain it to a friend over a flat white.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="diff-card reveal d4">
        <div class="diff-icon">🥝</div>
        <h3>Kiwi-specific — built for NZ to AU</h3>
        <p>Most immigration sites cover every country and every visa. We only cover one journey. That means every guide, every tool and every piece of advice is specific to the NZ → AU path — the Special Category Visa, Kiwi Super transfers, the ACC vs WorkCover difference and all the rest.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- DISCLAIMER -->
<section class="disclaimer-section">
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="disclaimer-inner">
      <h2>Important disclaimer</h2>
      <p>GoAustralia.co.nz is an independently operated website. We are not affiliated with, endorsed by, or part of the Australian Government, the New Zealand Government, the Department of Home Affairs, or any official immigration body.</p>
      <p>All information on this site is based on publicly available Australian Government policy and is intended as a general guide only. Immigration law and policy can change without notice. While we update our guides every week, we cannot guarantee that all information is current at the time you read it.</p>
      <p><strong>We strongly recommend verifying all visa, tax and financial information with official sources</strong> — including the <a href="https://www.homeaffairs.gov.au" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Department of Home Affairs</a> (homeaffairs.gov.au) and the <a href="https://www.ato.gov.au" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australian Taxation Office</a> (ato.gov.au) — before making any immigration or financial decisions.</p>
      <p>Nothing on this site constitutes legal, financial or immigration advice. For complex situations, please consult a registered migration agent (MARA) or a qualified tax adviser.</p>
      <p>Questions or corrections? Email us at <a href="mailto:hello@goaustralia.co.nz">hello@goaustralia.co.nz</a></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- CTA BAND -->
<div class="cta-band">
  <div class="shell">
    <h2>Ready to start planning?</h2>
    <p>Join 12,400+ Kiwis who used GoAustralia to plan their move. $1.99/month, cancel anytime.</p>
    <a href="/signup" class="cta-band-btn">Get Full Access →</a>
  </div>
</div>

</Layout>
